# The ban list can't be saved: ban.txt is a directory, made after boot, so fopen fails even as root. Smokegod (60)
# bans a site permanently, which saves the list. save_bans logged the error with perror and then wrote to the
# NULL it got, a segfault (#18). Now it logs the error and returns: the ban stands until the game stops, it's
# listed, and the game goes on; allow saves the list again, and fails the same way. @log shows the perror
# line among the steps.
@log
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@mkdir ban.txt
permban badsite.example all
ban
allow badsite.example
ban
say still here
